<PolicyLayout title="Weekly Membership Policy" updated="August 10, 2026">
	<p>By enrolling in a Weekly Cleaning Membership, you agree to the following terms:</p>

	<h2>Minimum Commitment</h2>
	<p>This membership requires a minimum commitment of 8 completed weekly cleaning services (approximately 2 months).</p>
	<p>The minimum commitment is fulfilled by completed recurring cleaning services. Scheduled cleanings that are skipped, canceled, or missed do not count toward fulfilling the minimum commitment and will extend the membership until the required number of completed services has been provided.</p>
	<p>If the membership is canceled before the minimum commitment has been fulfilled, the client will be responsible for the remaining payments due under the minimum commitment.</p>

	<h2>Square Footage</h2>
	<p>Quoted prices are based on the square footage entered at signup. We confirm your home's actual square footage at your first cleaning. If it's different from what was submitted, we'll adjust your membership price to reflect your home's actual size for that visit and any future ones.</p>

	<h2>Billing</h2>
	<p>Memberships are billed automatically to the payment method on file on the day of each scheduled service, not in advance of it.</p>

	<h2>Scheduling</h2>
	<p>Weekly cleanings are scheduled on the same day and approximate time each week at the time of enrollment. Requests to change your recurring service day are subject to availability.</p>

	<h2>Skip Policy</h2>
	<p>Members may skip up to two scheduled cleanings per rolling 12-month period, provided at least 48 hours' notice is given. Additional skips may be approved at Sky House Cleaning's discretion. Skipped appointments do not count toward fulfilling a membership's minimum commitment.</p>

	<h2>Rescheduling</h2>
	<p>Appointments may be rescheduled with at least 24 hours' notice, subject to availability.</p>

	<h2>Late Cancellations</h2>
	<p>Appointments canceled 24–48 hours before the scheduled service will incur a 50% cancellation fee. Appointments canceled less than 24 hours before the scheduled service will incur a 100% cancellation fee.</p>

	<h2>No-Shows</h2>
	<p>If our cleaning professionals arrive for a scheduled appointment and are unable to complete the service because access to the property is unavailable or the appointment is otherwise missed without notice, the appointment will be considered a no-show and charged 100% of the scheduled service price. No-shows do not count toward fulfilling a membership's minimum commitment.</p>

	<h2>Booking & Availability</h2>
	<p>Appointments are subject to staff availability. Requests to change recurring service days or appointment times will be accommodated whenever possible but cannot be guaranteed.</p>

	<h2>Membership Cancellation</h2>
	<p>After the minimum commitment has been fulfilled, memberships may be canceled at any time by contacting Sky House Cleaning at least 7 days before the next billing date.</p>

	<h2>Failed Payments</h2>
	<p>If a payment cannot be processed, future services may be paused until the outstanding balance has been resolved.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
